  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Tai Bai Yun Sheng arrive by stargate; Hei Lou Lan and Fairy Li Shan are already waiting on the snow field. Tai Bai Yun Sheng recounts that Reckless Savage Demon Venerable once fought strong enemies here, destroyed the place into void, then turned into an immemorial ice phoenix and breathed absolute profound ice to freeze and restore it. Fairy Li Shan brings small family qi Gu to store qi for the ascension, and Hei Lou Lan begins by releasing the seal on her ten extreme aperture so it shatters on its own. Clouds form, the ice surface cracks, earth qi rises like a fountain, and mortal winds and snow cover the field while Fang Yuan stays in the open as the others hide.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
        "gu_small_family_qi_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the north-most part of Northern Plains it is a field of snow with absolute silence.",
      "chapters": [
        683
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Reckless Savage Demon Venerable froze and restored the place as an immemorial ice phoenix, leaving a large icy plain.",
      "chapters": [
        686
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Li Shan names the site an icy plain. Reckless Savage Demon Venerable repaired the void as an immemorial ice phoenix, freezing it into a large icy plain. The ice phoenix transformation is a transformation path killer move, and as creator of the icy plain he imprinted strength path and transformation path true meaning in that heaven and earth. A circulated rumor says that if a strength path or transformation path Gu Master ascends to Gu Immortal there, dao fragments resonate and evoke that true meaning. Forms such as the icefall divine ape and ancient pegasi are true meanings taking earthly calamity shape; destroying those forms lets the small true meaning enter the destroyer.",
      "chapters": [
        686
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-meaning-remnant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_strength",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rumor is reported to come from Chu Du, Domination Immortal, who became a strength path Gu Immortal on this icy plain about three hundred years earlier.",
      "chapters": [
        687
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-meaning-remnant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xue Song Zi and Hei Cheng later find the tribulation site and treat the rumor as confirmed when they see the strength path phantoms and true meaning fight.",
      "chapters": [
        688
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-meaning-remnant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
